        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not go in yourself, curious as you are?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there anything worth the curiosity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island's people are all on their way. She can't stay here for long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If I've kept track of the time right, they should be here now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, that puk gaai Lung. Who knows where she's frolicking about right now while we're left working overtime.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If Ch'en heard her old classmate walked a million miles looking for her, she'd be at least a little ruffled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "She won't say it, but she's always been loyal to her friends, Missy, and you know that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do her friends matter to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you, you absolutely sent a message to Rhodes Island the moment you got the tip-off. Why the effort to interrogate her too? Do you love it, playing the bad cop?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Best to go through proper procedures, what with all the kids on the force watching.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, don't you wanna do a little finding out, see what new dangers old Ch'en might get into?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...No thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, I'm so done with this! Once Rhodes Island picks her up from in there, you're giving me a clear, thorough report... No slacking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Swire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
        "name2": "char_308_swire_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha ha, alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, here's the Rhodes Island operator to lead her away\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
