    {
        "text": "Ehhhhh, what?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "So Chenchen's actually left the L.G.D. already? You're telling me I need to go somewhere else now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, what was that company called...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Rhooodes\u2014Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
